IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `aia-core`
IMPORT `aia-timeline`
IMPORT `P9-gate`

-- P9-art-102-110: Chapter XIII "Final provisions": Articles 102 to 110 amend other instruments. Articles 102 to 109 each add to a
-- Regulation or Directive a rule that, when the Commission adopts delegated or implementing acts concerning AI systems that are
-- safety components, the requirements of Chapter III Section 2 shall be taken into account: they are amendments of other Acts and
-- are `inert` (reason 2) in NOTES.md, with the words of each cited there. Article 110 adds this Regulation to Annex I of
-- Directive (EU) 2020/1828 (representative actions for the protection of the collective interests of consumers), which gives a
-- person a way to complain that an Act's other provisions do not: it is encoded below, for the person seat.
-- Group `Articles 102 to 110` (Article 113(d): 27 July 2026 as amended; as enacted the general date, 2 August 2026).
-- Seam: whether the action is a representative action within the meaning of Directive (EU) 2020/1828, and who may bring it, is that
-- Directive's own text, which is not among the sources: an input, and NOTHING when it is not met.

§ `Article 110: Annex I of Directive (EU) 2020/1828`

-- src:1613 | In Annex I to Directive (EU) 2020/1828 of the European Parliament and of the Council (
-- src:1614 | [^3]
-- src:1615 | ), the following point is added:
-- src:1616 | ‘(68)
-- src:1617 | Regulation (EU) 2024/1689 of the European Parliament and of the Council of 13 June 2024 laying down harmonised rules on artificial intelligence and amending Regulations (EC) No 300/2008, (EU) No 167/2013, (EU) No 168/2013, (EU) 2018/858, (EU) 2018/1139 and (EU) 2019/2144 and Directives 2014/90/EU, (EU) 2016/797 and (EU) 2020/1828 (Artificial Intelligence Act) (OJ L, 2024/1689, 12.7.2024, ELI: http://data.europa.eu/eli/reg/2024/1689/oj).’.
@ref Art 110 (src:1613-1617)
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE
      `the action is a representative action within the meaning of Directive (EU) 2020/1828` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the action concerns an infringement of Regulation (EU) 2024/1689` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Art 110 Regulation (EU) 2024/1689 is listed in Annex I to Directive (EU) 2020/1828 for the action` MEANS
    IF NOT (`Arts 102 to 110 the group Articles 102 to 110 applies` `the date asked`)
    THEN NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): Article 113 gives this provision its date of application; before that the Regulation is not added to the Annex
    ELSE IF       `the action is a representative action within the meaning of Directive (EU) 2020/1828`
              AND `the action concerns an infringement of Regulation (EU) 2024/1689`
         THEN JUST TRUE  -- the other conditions of the Directive (a qualified entity, the collective interests of consumers) are that Directive's own, outside the sources
         ELSE NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (points outside the text): the Article adds the Regulation to the list of the Directive's Annex I; whether another action is within the Directive is for the Directive
